# Loran of the Third Path: "{T}: You and target opponent each draw a card." Both players draw in turn order from the active
# player (CR 121.2c), and Loran can be activated on the opponent's turn. Both libraries are empty and each player controls
# Jace, Wielder of Mysteries ("If you would draw a card while your library has no cards in it, you win the game instead"). Bot1
# activates Loran on turn 4, Bot2's turn: Bot2, the active player, draws first and wins, not Loran's controller.

